<title>USA: Freshstart Venture completes IPO.</title>
<headline>Freshstart Venture completes IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freshstart Venture Capital Corp said on Monday that it completed an initial public offering of one million shares of common stock, which had been priced at $5 a share.</p>
<p>The managing underwriters for the offering were Suppes Securities Inc and National Securities Corp.</p>
<p>Freshstart, which provides loan financing, said it would use the net proceeds from the offering of $3.8 million to make additional secured loans.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
